## Security Notes

- **TLS private key** (`receptor/tls/receptor.key`) is sensitive
- Delete bundle after successful installation
- Do not store bundle in version control
- Transfer via secure channel only

## Troubleshooting

**Receptor won't start:**
```bash
journalctl -u receptor -f
podman logs receptor
```

**No heartbeat after 5 minutes:**
```bash
# Check receptor can reach peers
podman exec receptor receptorctl ping {{ _parsed_peers[0] }}

# Check firewall allows 27199
firewall-cmd --list-ports
```

**Certificate errors:**
```bash
# Verify certificate dates
openssl x509 -in receptor/tls/receptor.crt -noout -dates

# Verify hostname matches
openssl x509 -in receptor/tls/receptor.crt -noout -text | grep DNS
```

